flowchart TD
    START([User Query]) --> ANALYSIS[LLM Analysis: Intent & Entity Extraction]
    ANALYSIS --> TICKER{Ticker Found?}
    
    TICKER -- No --> RESOLVE[TickerService: Resolve Company Names]
    RESOLVE --> VALIDATE{Validated?}
    
    TICKER -- Yes --> FETCH
    VALIDATE -- Yes --> FETCH[Parallel Data Fetch: yFinance]
    VALIDATE -- No --> ERROR[Return Partial/Greeting Response]
    
    FETCH --> CONTEXT[Context Assembly & Reasoning]
    CONTEXT --> END([Final Context String])
